{"id":"7a7ac1c668908eae","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-typed-language.md","title":"类型化语言","display":"df-typed-language — 类型化语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-typed-language","aliases":["91-df-typed-language"],"display":"df-typed-language — 类型化语言","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-typed-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-typed-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-typed-language — 类型化语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-typed-language-—-类型化语言-$\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}$\">df-typed-language — 类型化语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> (基础语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T^n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((T^n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (两两不同且不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 的新一元谓词符号)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L}^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L}^{1}\\)</span> (语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 的一元谓词符号集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}typed\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_T^n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_0[\\{T^k:k&lt;n\\}]\n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal L_T^\\omega\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_0[\\{T^k:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}typed\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_T^n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_0[\\{T^k:k&lt;n\\}]\n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal L_T^\\omega\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_0[\\{T^k:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T^0=\\mathcal L_0,\\qquad\n\\mathcal L_T^{n+1}=\\mathcal L_T^n[T^n],\\qquad\n\\mathcal L_T^\\omega=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal L_T^n,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L_T^0=\\mathcal L_0,\\qquad\n\\mathcal L_T^{n+1}=\\mathcal L_T^n[T^n],\\qquad\n\\mathcal L_T^\\omega=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal L_T^n,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T^k\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}^{1}\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad k&lt;n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T^k\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}^{1}\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad k&lt;n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}\\)</span> : 类型化语言（带类型索引的真理谓词序列）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> : 第n层真理谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}\\)</span> : 第n层类型化语言</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：类型化语言包含一列真理谓词\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^0,T^1,T^2,\\ldots\">\\(T^0,T^1,T^2,\\ldots\\)</span>。语言分层本身只控制哪些谓词符号可以出现在\n哪一层公式中；“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> 对哪些编码满足双条件式”还须由相应的分层真理\n公理规定，不能仅由句法成员关系推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-typed-language-—-类型化语言-$\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}$","text":"df-typed-language — 类型化语言 $\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_0$ (基础语言, see [[91-df-ground-language]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"(T^n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L}^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}typed\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L_T^n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_0[\\{T^k:k<n\\}]\n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal L_T^\\omega\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal L_0[\\{T^k:k\\in\\mathbb N\\}].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T^0=\\mathcal L_0,\\qquad\n\\mathcal L_T^{n+1}=\\mathcal L_T^n[T^n],\\qquad\n\\mathcal L_T^\\omega=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal L_T^n,","display":true},{"tex":"k,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T^k\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}^{1}\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad k<n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"T^0,T^1,T^2,\\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false}],"bytes":1539,"backlinks":[{"id":"297207ea3fca7fff","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}$ (类型化语言, see [[91-df-typed-language]])"},{"id":"19dd1f8599ff0195","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_T^{\\omega}$ (类型化语言, see [[91-df-typed-language]])"},{"id":"00a1e20ba65f1f5a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_T^n$、$T^n$ 为 [[91-df-typed-language]] 的有限分层语言和谓词；$S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是经典 $\\mathcal L_T$ 理论。"},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-typed-language]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-typed-language]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-ext